{
  "_comment": "Versioned Grafana dashboard for Euthus. Import via Grafana UI -> Dashboards -> Import -> Upload JSON. Designed for the default Prometheus datasource; no per-instance hard-codes. Replace the datasource UID by selecting your data source on import. Panels group into RED (api), USE (worker resources), DLQ, Web Vitals (RUM), and a tracing link. Histogram quantile queries assume the standard buckets defined in backend/src/infrastructure/metrics/registry.ts.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "title": "Euthus — service overview",
  "uid": "euthus-overview",
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "tags": ["euthus", "accessibility", "rum", "slo"],
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROM",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 100,
      "title": "RED — API",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API request rate (req/s)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{route=~\"/api/.*\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API 5xx ratio (rolling 5m)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{route=~\"/api/.*\",status_class=\"5xx\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_count{route=~\"/api/.*\"}[5m])), 0.0001)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API latency by quantile (s)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=~\"/api/.*\"}[5m])))",
          "refId": "p50",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=~\"/api/.*\"}[5m])))",
          "refId": "p95",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=~\"/api/.*\"}[5m])))",
          "refId": "p99",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" } },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 200,
      "title": "Worker — audit pipeline",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Audits in flight",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(audits_in_flight)", "refId": "A" }],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 8 }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Queue depth by status",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (status) (audit_queue_depth)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 9, "x": 6, "y": 8 }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Audit duration p50 / p95 / p99 (s) — SLO p95 ≤ 30s",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(audit_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "p50",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(audit_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "p95",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(audit_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "refId": "p99",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 30 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 9, "x": 15, "y": 8 }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Audit failures by reason (per 5m)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(audit_failure_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Puppeteer browser relaunches",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(puppeteer_browser_relaunch_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "relaunches/s"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 300,
      "title": "DLQ — dead-letter queue",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "DLQ moves (last 24h, by reason)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(audit_dead_letter_total[24h]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "DLQ rate (per 5m, by reason)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(audit_dead_letter_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 400,
      "title": "RUM — Real User Monitoring (web-vitals)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 27 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LCP p75 by route (s) — good ≤ 2.5",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.75, sum by (route, le) (rate(web_vital_lcp_seconds_bucket[15m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 2.5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 4 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 28 }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "INP p75 by route (s) — good ≤ 0.2",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.75, sum by (route, le) (rate(web_vital_inp_seconds_bucket[15m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.2 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 28 }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CLS p75 by route — good ≤ 0.1",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.75, sum by (route, le) (rate(web_vital_cls_bucket[15m])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.25 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 28 }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RUM beacons rejected (per 5m, by reason)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROM}" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(web_vital_rejected_total[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 34 }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tracing",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Distributed traces are exported via OTLP/HTTP to Tempo Cloud (configurable via `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT`). Click an audit's `publicId` in any log line and search the trace explorer for the matching `audit.public_id` span attribute.\n\nKey spans:\n\n- `audit.enqueue` — api side, attached to the `POST /api/audits` HTTP span.\n- `audit.process` — worker dispatch, restored from the W3C `traceparent` so it shares the api trace id.\n- `audit.run` — Puppeteer + axe under the dispatch span.\n\nSee [docs/adr/0004-opentelemetry-tracing.md](https://github.com/NicolasDeNigris91/AccessibilityProject/blob/main/docs/adr/0004-opentelemetry-tracing.md)."
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 34 }
    }
  ]
}
